      "writtenOn": "2023-11-14T08:41:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This might be a bit confusing since this map is available on T+ devices.\nAlso, BpfNetMaps allows to update this map on T+ devices.\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Connectivity/service/src/com/android/server/BpfNetMaps.java;l\u003d867\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Connectivity/service/src/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java;l\u003d12780\n\nMaybe we can mark T+?\nAnd add comment on the caller?",
