      "writtenOn": "2023-11-14T09:41:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes this is confusing.\nConnectivityService#setDataSaverEnabled itself is supported on T+.\nBut no platform code (NetworkManagementService) will call setDataSaverEnabled until V.\nThus, getting the status before V is not valid.\nGiven that any caller who has enough permission could call this.\nI think it is better to add notes on this method.\nSee if it works for you.",
